    <description>SS-748:What: Cloned POC requests are carrying over details populated in the “Order Ops Detail” section. Need to clear out the field values for that section upon cloning for Record Types&gt; On Prem, Taas, Tanium Cloud for US Gov. All other fields are fine as they are when cloned.

Why: Order Ops Detail section is unique to original requests but cannot be applied to cloned extension requests.</description>
